---

## Dashboard Sections

### Migration History

Displays previous migration executions.

Contains

- Project Name
- Status
- Duration
- Execution Time

---

### Progress Tracking

Displays

- Files Scanned
- Files Migrated
- Remaining Files
- Completion Percentage

---

### Metrics

Displays migration metrics such as

- Components
- Modules
- Services
- Signals
- Bundle Score
- Tree Shaking Score

---

### Performance

Tracks

- Change Detection Optimization
- Signals Migration
- Dead Code Removal
- Bundle Performance
- Tree Shaking Score

---

### Charts

Prepared chart-ready datasets for

- Migration Progress
- Performance
- Routing Analysis

---

### Validation

Displays

- Build Status
- Lint Status
- Dependency Installation Status
- Validation Logs

---

### Report Summary

Shows

- Total Reports
- Latest Report
- Report Generation Time

---

### PR Summary

Displays

- PR Title
- Files Changed
- Additions
- Deletions
- Summary

---

### AI Dashboard

Displays

- Project Risk
- Confidence Score
- Risk Score
- Risk Factors
- Recommendations

---

# REST APIs

Implemented

GET /dashboard

Returns complete dashboard data.

---

GET /dashboard/history

Returns migration history.

---

GET /dashboard/metrics

Returns migration metrics.

---

GET /dashboard/performance

Returns performance statistics.

---

GET /dashboard/ai

Returns AI dashboard information.

---

